  "name": "bantamlisp",
  "description": "A Rust implementation of the TinyLisp interpreter, primarily derived from C source code via the c2rust transpilation tool. The project integrates environment-based configuration and provides a structured harness for benchmarking and integration testing of the Lisp runtime. It serves as a technical prototype for migrating legacy interpreter logic into a memory-safe systems programming environment while preserving original execution semantics.",
